onic World War II aircraft</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2308690/extras/8a581266fe69fd1b07836dd8dfa02f01.poster.avif?t=1786949569\" width=1170 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2308690/extras/8a581266fe69fd1b07836dd8dfa02f01.webm?t=1786949569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a variety of accurate fighter airplanes. A joy for aviation aficionados who know the difference between a Hurricane and a Spitfire. But consider: bigger airplanes will need bigger infrastructure. So make sure you can house some of WW2's most impressive airplanes. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Take care of your pilots and crew</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2308690/extras/61c3cfe6b95fcc79e5168b89850b57ef.poster.avif?t=1786949569\" width=1170 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2308690/extras/61c3cfe6b95fcc79e5168b89850b57ef.webm?t=1786949569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience personal stories of your air base crew members. On your base every person matters and has their own personality. The game takes huge inspiration from the everyday life of airplane bases in remote locations and how it felt to live there, in good and bad times. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>In the style of Franco-Belgian bande dessinée</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2308690/extras/0b71bd3037fbb8c0e808d9652c26def1.poste